# Store art page kit. Commit the sources (slots.html, header.html, kit.*, copy.js, COPY_NOTES.md,
# tools/) and the PICKED art in art/, page-sized, each with its provenance .txt: it cost credits
# to make. Keyed PNGs at 512 px on the long side (the largest draw on a page is about 360 px),
# opaque photos as JPEG q90 (about 90% smaller than the PNG). Everything below is either
# reproducible from the Higgsfield library by generation id, or rebuilt by the tools.
art/**/*-src.png
art/**/*rejected*
art/**/*.log
art/**/checks/
# Renders: ui/ comes from the storeart module (storeart/scripts/export.sh), out/ from tools/.
ui/
out/
checks/
